  "answer": "The record for the highest number of World Rally Championship race entries by an individual is held by **Sébastien Ogier**, with 214 entries (based on Guinness World Records) (E3).\n\nWhile the Guinness World Records page itself did not list his father's name, a related article titled \"AUTO - Rencontre avec… Chantal et François Ogier racontent l’ascension de Sébastien Parents comblés\" indicates that his father is **François Ogier** (E5).",
